@startuml
!theme plain
title LocalMesh — Mesh Architecture & Optional Internet Bridge

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false

package "Local Mesh (ad-hoc, P2P)" {
  [Device A\n(node + relay)]
  [Device B\n(node + relay)]
  [Device C\n(node + relay)]
  [Local Discovery\n(mDNS / BLE beacons)]
  [Store-and-Forward\nQueue (per node)]
  [Local Directory\n(peer list / feed)]
}

package "Optional Bridge" {
  [Internet Bridge Node]
  [Sync Relay Service\n(opt-in)]
}

[Device A] <--> [Device B] : encrypted peer chat (E2E)
[Device B] <--> [Device C] : hop-by-hop routing
[Device C] <--> [Device A] : redundant path
[Local Discovery] <--> [Device A]
[Local Discovery] <--> [Device B]
[Local Discovery] <--> [Device C]
[Device A] --> [Store-and-Forward Queue] : hold if peer offline
[Device B] --> [Local Directory] : share files/images
[Device C] --> [Local Directory]
[Internet Bridge Node] <--> [Device A] : designated node w/ internet
[Internet Bridge Node] --> [Sync Relay Service] : opt-in sync

note right of Internet Bridge Node
  Fully optional. Mesh works
  with zero internet access;
  bridge only adds cloud sync.
end note

@enduml